</math> square miles. What is the area, in <span style="text-decoration: underline;">square yards</span>, of this town? <math alttext="left parenthesis 1 mile  equals 1,760 yards right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>mile</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1,760</mn></mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>yards</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"b2d839f0-6a19-42d8-857a-9ad30c5422a8","content":"<p><math alttext=\"404\"><mn>404</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"3b69aedc-390e-404e-9537-d6adeb74d1a0","content":"<p><math alttext=\"7,674\"><mn>7,674</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"8af35491-a0bb-46bf-8d80-a1d246f0b83c","content":"<p><math alttext=\"710,459\"><mn>710,459</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"a82d6e90-3ce6-46a0-8cc7-10f05c0a8550","content":"<p><math alttext=\"13,505,536\"><mn>13,505,536</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["a82d6e90-3ce6-46a0-8cc7-10f05c0a8550"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice D is correct. Since the number of yards in <math alttext="1"><mn>1</mn>
